This repository holds the source code and release files of Aftr Hrs, a custom mod made for the private Aftr Hrs
Minecraft server.

The release files may be downloaded and used to play on Minecraft servers. The source code is published so that it can
be read and built for personal use. Neither the release files nor the source code, nor any of the art, models, sounds or
other assets in them, may be redistributed, modified for redistribution, or sold without permission.
